      "Array-of-objects bodies ARE expressible in spec v1: declarativeRuntime.renderBody walks arrays, specSchema accepts an array request.body, and a solo placeholder keeps its resolved JSON type (verified: [{keywords: '{{input.keywords}}'}] renders the real array, and an absent optional key is dropped). No fallback to GET-only endpoints was needed.",
