      "location_code and language_code are required inputs on the SERP and search-volume tools because DataForSEO rejects a task that carries neither location_code nor location_name, and spec v1 has no default-value helper for strings. The numeric defaults it does have are applied via clamp (depth 10, internal_list_limit 10).",
      "Every Live call is billed per task by DataForSEO. rateLimit 20/min is a spend guard chosen here, not a documented API ceiling; the account's real ceilings are readable at runtime via the user_data tool (rate_limit_minute, spend_limit_day).",
